# Current Database Architecture

## UnplannedProjectEntity

Represents the knowledge hierarchy.

Contains

* node title
* parent relationship
* ordering
* completion
* expected duration
* accent information

This table defines

**What the topic is.**

It does not contain revision information.

---

## SessionEntity

Represents work history.

Stores

* start time
* end time
* duration
* session name
* expected duration

Sessions create the chronological learning history.

---

## SessionNoteEntity

Stores

* summary
* timestamps

One note per session.

Relationship

```
Session

↓

Revision Note
```

---

## SessionNoteAttachmentEntity

Stores

* image path
* creation time

Relationship

```
Session

↓

Attachments
```

Attachments are not directly linked to notes.

The relationship is

```
Session

├── Revision Note

└── Attachments
```

Since there is only one note per session, attachments are implicitly part of that note.

