# Future Expansion

The architecture intentionally leaves room for

* automatic revision tracking
* spaced repetition
* revision reminders
* AI-generated summaries
* important sections
* confidence score
* backup/export
* analytics
* revision statistics

without requiring changes to the existing Notes architecture.

